    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Communication sphere; one of Performance sphere ((dance) package), bardic performance, psionics, or raging song; Posse Commander.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you start a dance, bardic performance, psionics, or raging song, you may reveal a plan to allow all allies in your posse to benefit from the effects regardless of range or line of sight.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/squadron-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
